{"book":"ezekiel","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T08:42:34.827727241Z","verse":18,"ref":"ezekiel 13:18","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":13,"translation":"And you shall say, Thus says Adonai GOD: Woe to those sewing cushions upon all arm-joints, and making veils upon the head of every stature, to hunt souls! The souls you hunt ⟨are⟩ the souls of my people, and the souls that come to you — ⟨them⟩ you keep alive.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואמרת","gloss":"And you shall say"},{"surface":"כה","gloss":"Thus"},{"surface":"אמר","gloss":"says"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"Adonai"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"GOD"},{"surface":"הוי","gloss":"Woe"},{"surface":"למתפרות","gloss":"to those sewing"},{"surface":"כסתות","gloss":"cushions"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"upon"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"all"},{"surface":"אצילי","gloss":"arm-joints"},{"surface":"ידי","gloss":"of hands"},{"surface":"ועשות","gloss":"and making"},{"surface":"המספחות","gloss":"veils"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"upon"},{"surface":"ראש","gloss":"the head"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"of every"},{"surface":"קומה","gloss":"stature"},{"surface":"לצודד","gloss":"to hunt"},{"surface":"נפשות","gloss":"souls"},{"surface":"הנפשות","gloss":"The souls"},{"surface":"תצודדנה","gloss":"you hunt"},{"surface":"לעמי","gloss":"of my people"},{"surface":"ונפשות","gloss":"and the souls"},{"surface":"לכנה","gloss":"that come to you"},{"surface":"תחיינה","gloss":"you keep alive"}]}